{{define "title"}}Cookie Policy - View MPP{{end}}

{{define "main"}}
<main class="page page--text legal centered">
  <header class="page__head">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  </header>

  <p>
    View MPP uses cookies to support sign-in, protect forms, and remember access to
    password-protected plans. We also use local storage to remember your appearance preference
    and when you dismiss the sharing prompt. We do not use these technologies to track you
    across websites, and we do not use analytics or advertising trackers.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small values saved by your browser and sent back to this site with requests.
    Local storage keeps preferences in your browser; those values are not automatically sent
    with requests. All the items listed below are set by View MPP for this site.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies we use</h2>
  <table role="table" class="legal__table legal__table--cookies" aria-label="Cookies used by View MPP">
    <thead role="rowgroup">
      <tr role="row"><th role="columnheader" scope="col">Name</th><th role="columnheader" scope="col">Purpose and when it is set</th><th role="columnheader" scope="col">How long it lasts</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody role="rowgroup">
      <tr role="row">
        <th role="rowheader" scope="row"><code>__Host-session</code></th>
        <td role="cell" data-label="Purpose">Remembers sign-in, access after you unlock a protected plan, and temporary messages between pages. Set when one of these actions needs a session.</td>
        <td role="cell" data-label="How long it lasts">Until the session expires. The default lifetime is 12 hours; renewing a session starts a new lifetime. Signing out removes this cookie.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr role="row">
        <th role="rowheader" scope="row"><code>__Host-csrf</code></th>
        <td role="cell" data-label="Purpose">Helps protect forms against forged submissions. Set when a page needs a form-security token, and replaced when a session is renewed.</td>
        <td role="cell" data-label="How long it lasts">Expires at the session expiry time used when it is set. The default session lifetime is 12 hours.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>
    The session cookie contains a random identifier linked to session information on our server.
    Neither cookie contains your uploaded plan or password. Both are sent only over HTTPS and
    cannot be read by JavaScript. Closing your browser does not necessarily remove them.
  </p>

  <h2>Preferences saved in your browser</h2>
  <table role="table" class="legal__table legal__table--cookies" aria-label="Local storage used by View MPP">
    <thead role="rowgroup">
      <tr role="row"><th role="columnheader" scope="col">Name</th><th role="columnheader" scope="col">Purpose and when it is saved</th><th role="columnheader" scope="col">How long it lasts</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody role="rowgroup">
      <tr role="row">
        <th role="rowheader" scope="row"><code>mpp-theme</code></th>
        <td role="cell" data-label="Purpose">Remembers light, dark, or system mode after you choose an appearance setting.</td>
        <td role="cell" data-label="How long it lasts">No automatic expiry. Kept until you or your browser clear this site's data; choosing another mode updates it.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr role="row">
        <th role="rowheader" scope="row"><code>mpp-send-dismissed</code></th>
        <td role="cell" data-label="Purpose">Remembers that you dismissed the prompt about sharing your own plans when viewing someone else's shared plan. Saved only when you dismiss it.</td>
        <td role="cell" data-label="How long it lasts">No automatic expiry. Kept until you or your browser clear this site's data.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can change the appearance using the Light, Dark, and System controls in the navigation.
    Signing out removes the sign-in cookie, but does not clear your saved appearance or prompt
    preference, or necessarily remove the form-security cookie.
  </p>
  <p>
    To remove all the items listed here, open your browser's privacy or site-data settings,
    find this site's address, and clear its cookies and site data, including local storage.
    Clearing only cookies may leave local storage in place. You can also use your browser's
    settings to block storage for this site.
  </p>
  <p>
    Clearing site data can sign you out, remove remembered access to protected plans, and reset
    your preferences. Blocking cookies can prevent sign-in and form submissions from working.
    Clearing browser data does not delete your account or plans saved to it. Reloading or closing
    a tab also discards any unsaved plan you are viewing.
  </p>

  <h2>Updates and contact</h2>
  <p>
    We update this policy when our use of cookies or local storage changes. For information about
    accounts, uploaded files, and other personal data, read our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    Questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:support@viewmpp.com">support@viewmpp.com</a>.
  </p>
  <p class="legal__meta">Last updated: 8 September 2026</p>
</main>

{{template "sitefooter" .}}
{{end}}
